{# Reusable model for every /account/profile-settings/* page.

    Extends backoffice/base.html.twig so we inherit the backoffice layout
    (sidebar + flash loop + impersonation banner). Defines five overridable
    blocks:

      settings_title     Browser <title> inner segment. The outer title block
                          in backoffice/base.html.twig appends " — KTN Gestión",
                         so sections only need to set this to e.g.
                         "Change password". Defaults to "Profile & Settings".

      settings_h1        Visible page heading. Defaults to "Profile & Settings"
                         so every settings page — hub and sections alike —
                         carries the parent context. Sections usually leave
                         this default; the breadcrumb carries the section
                         name instead.

      settings_subtitle  Small descriptive line under h1. Defaults to
                         "Your identity and configuration." Sections may
                         override for a section-specific description.

      settings_content   Page body. The hub fills this with the h2 "Settings"
                         heading + menu card. Section pages fill it with a
                         breadcrumb + the section card (form, etc.).

    The base always renders, in order:
      1. Page heading (h1 + subtitle)
      2. Profile header card (avatar/name/email/state/roles), so the user
         sees their identity on every page
      3. A wrapper around settings_content

    No back affordance on the base — back navigation is content-only
    (a breadcrumb on section pages). The hub has no "back" because it is
    the root of /account/profile-settings/*.
#}
{% extends 'backoffice/base.html.twig' %}

{% block admin_title %}{% block settings_title %}{{ 'app.account.profile.title'|trans }}{% endblock %}{% endblock %}

{% block admin_body %}
    <header class="mb-6">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-900">
            {%- block settings_h1 -%}{{ 'app.account.profile.title'|trans }}{%- endblock -%}
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-stone-500">
            {%- block settings_subtitle -%}{{ 'app.account.profile.subtitle'|trans }}{%- endblock -%}
        </p>
    </header>

    {% include 'account/_profile_header.html.twig' %}

    <div class="mt-8">
        {% block settings_content %}{% endblock %}
    </div>
{% endblock %}